<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span>An example of the final code <math id="A1.F14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> generated for the shortest path task.</figcaption>
