<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>An example of the final code <math id="A1.F15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> generated for the maximum triangle sum task.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F16" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.12743v1/maxflow_example.png" id="A1.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/51;" width="476" height="51" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span>An example of the final code <math id="A1.F16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> generated for the maximum flow task.</figcaption>
