<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 21: </span>An example directed graph with edge weights. The correct maximum flow from node 2 to 6 is 3 but the Cypher query in Figure <a href="#A1.F20" title="Figure 20 ‣ Appendix A Example Code ‣ Zero-shot Graph Reasoning via Retrieval Augmented Framework with LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a> returns 4 as the answer.</figcaption>
</figure>
